---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Uses"
  description="Hardware, software, and development tools used for engineering work and writing."
>
  <section class="page-intro prose-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Uses</p>
    <h1>Hardware and software I rely on every day.</h1>
    <div class="uses-grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Hardware</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>14” laptop with a high-density display</li>
          <li>Mechanical keyboard with tactile switches</li>
          <li>Noise-cancelling headphones for focused coding</li>
          <li>4K external monitor for docs, dashboards, and code review</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Core software</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>VS Code with TypeScript-first workflows</li>
          <li>iTerm or terminal multiplexing for local orchestration</li>
          <li>GitHub for collaboration and CI</li>
          <li>Grafana and OpenTelemetry for observability</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Daily engineering stack</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>TypeScript and Node.js for product and platform work</li>
          <li>React for user-facing interfaces</li>
          <li>AWS services for dependable delivery pipelines</li>
          <li>Markdown and MDX for documentation and writing</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
